# Local SQLite database created by `prisma db push` / the dev server.
# At any depth: this template's database lives at `prisma/dev.db`, which is
# where both Prisma and gemi resolve `file:./dev.db` to. Unlike saas-starter,
# nothing here commits one as a test fixture.
**/dev.db
**/dev.db-journal
**/dev.db-wal
**/dev.db-shm
